      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "うちの父ちゃんを襲った悪い盗賊を\nやっつけてやりたいんだ！\nえ？　お兄ちゃんが退治してくれる？\n無理しなくていいよ？　弱そうだもん！",
        "official_en": "I want those thieves that attacked my dad gone, but\nI'm not strong enough to take them on... You say you\nwant to help? Well, good luck. To be honest, you\ndon't look strong enough to handle them either.",
        "real_en": null
      },
